hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"601","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Qalamein khushk ho chuki hain khush-naseeb aur bad-naseeb ke likhe jane ke baad, aur chaar cheezein teh ho chuki hain: Akhlaq, paidaish, maut, aur rizq."
"602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karti hain, woh kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah har bande ke liye paanch cheezein likh kar farigh ho chuka hai: Us ke a'mal, us ki maut, us ki zindagi, us ka rizq, aur us ka thikana. Koi banda un se aage nahin badh sakta jo Allah ne un ke bare mein likha hai."
"603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Main ne arz kiya, Ae Allah ke Rasul! Beshak, main ek naujawan, ghair-shadi-shuda aadmi hun, aur mujhe apne liye khwahish ke fitne ka darr hai. Mujhe khassi hone ki ijazat de deejiye. Pas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum par aane wala hai, qalam use likh kar khushk ho chuka hai, pas khwah tum khassi ho jao ya ruko (kuch tabdeel nahin hoga)."
"604","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo tum par aane wala hai, Qalam use likh kar khushk ho chuka hai."
"605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum logon mein sab se bure do-chehre wale ko paoge, jo in ke paas ek chehre se aur un ke paas doosre chehre se aata hai. Imam Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai, aur us mein hai: Jo in ke paas ek chehre se aur un ke paas doosre chehre se aata hai."
"606","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum logon ko kanon (sone-chandi ki) tarah paoge; jo daur-e-jahiliyat mein behtar thay woh Islam mein bhi behtar honge, basharteke unhen deen ki samajh ho. Aur (qayadat ke) mu'amle mein, tum apne mein sab se behtar use paoge jo use sab se zyada napasand karta ho, yahan tak ke woh us mein mubtala ho jae. Aur tum apne mein sab se bure do-chehre wale shakhs ko paoge, jo in logon ke paas ek chehre se aur un logon ke paas doosre chehre se aata hai."
"607","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mirdas Aslami (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek log ek ek kar ke rukhsat ho jayenge, yahan tak ke sirf khajoor ke chilkon jaise be-qeemat log reh jayenge; Allah un ki parwa bilkul nahin farmayega."
"608","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mustawrid Fahri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek log ek ek kar ke rukhsat ho jayenge, aur sirf khajoor ke chilkon jaise be-qeemat log reh jayenge; Allah un ki parwa bilkul nahin farmayega."
"609","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mustawrid Fahri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek log ek ek kar ke rukhsat ho jayenge, aur sirf khajoor ke chilkon jaise be-qeemat log reh jayenge; Allah un ki parwa bilkul nahin farmayega."
"610","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek apne bhai ki aankh mein tinka dekhta hai lekin apni aankh mein shahteer chhod deta hai."
"611","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sufyan bin Asid Hazrami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sab se badi khayanat yeh hai ke tum apne bhai se kisi baat par guftagu karo aur woh tumhen sachcha samjhe, halanke tum us se jhoot bol rahe ho."
"612","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sufyan bin Asid (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah riwayat hai, aur unhon ne kaha: Sab se badi khayanat yeh hai ke tum apne bhai se koi baat kaho jis mein woh tumhen sachcha samjhe, halanke tum us se jhoot bol rahe ho."
"613","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sufyan bin Asid Hazrami (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sab se badi khayanat yeh hai ke tum apne bhai se kisi cheez ke sath guftagu karo jis mein woh tumhen sachcha samjhe, halanke tum us se jhoot bol rahe ho."
"614","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein apni oontni Jad'a par baithe hue khutba diya, aur apne khutbe mein Aap ne farmaya: Ae logo! ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"615","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rukb Misri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khush-khabri us shakhs ke liye jis ne aajizi ikhtiyar ki halanke us mein koi aib ya nuqs nahin, khud ko kamtar samjha halanke woh mohtaj ya zaroorat-mand nahin, us maal mein se kharch kiya jo us ne baghair gunah ke jama kiya tha, ahl-e-fiqh o hikmat ki suhbat ikhtiyar ki, aur miskeenon o mohtajon par raham kiya. Khush-khabri us shakhs ke liye jis ki kamayi pak hai, jis ka batin achcha hai, jis ka zahir umda hai, aur jis ne apna shar logon se door rakha. Khush-khabri us shakhs ke liye jis ne apne ilm par amal kiya, apne za'id maal mein se kharch kiya, aur ghair-zaroori guftagu se parhez kiya."
"616","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fazalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Khush-khabri us shakhs ke liye jo Islam ki taraf hidayat paya, jis ki ma'ishat bas-kafi hai, aur jise qana'at ata ki gayi hai."
"617","[AI-translation] Hazrat Fazalah bin Ubaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh kamyab hua jo Islam ki taraf hidayat paya, jis ki ma'ishat us ki zaroorat ke liye kafi hai, aur jo us par qani' hai jo use diya gaya hai."
"618","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Ibn Adam! Jo tumhare paas hai woh tumhare liye kafi hai, phir bhi tum woh talash karte ho jo tumhen sarkash banayega. Ae Ibn Adam! Tum thode par qani' nahin, aur zyada par sair nahin hote. Jab tum subah is halat mein utho ke jismani taur par tandrust ho, apne mutalliq mehfooz aur be-khauf ho, aur tumhare paas din ka khana ho, to duniya par mitti daal do."
"619","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas koi sa'il aata ya koi tum se hajat talab karta, to Aap farmate: Sifarish karo, tumhen ajar diya jayega, aur Allah apne Nabi ki zaban se woh faisla farmayega jo woh chahega."
"620","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, mere paas sa'il laya jata hai aur koi mujh se hajat ke bare mein poochta hai, aur tum mere sath maujood ho, pas us ke liye sifarish karo; tumhen ajar diya jayega, aur Allah apne Nabi ki zaban par jo chahega faisla farmayega."
"621","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain, aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya, aur us mein hai: Sifarish karo, tumhen zaroor ajar diya jayega."
"622","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Safar karo, tandrust rahoge aur ghaneemat paoge."
"623","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"624","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aasani karo, mushkil na karo; itminan dilao, nafrat na phailao."
"625","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Aasani karo, mushkil na karo; khush-khabri do, nafrat na phailao."
"626","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miyana-rawi ikhtiyar karo aur seedhe raho, kyunke tum mein se koi sirf apne a'mal se nijat nahin payega. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Kya aap bhi nahin? Aap ne farmaya: Main bhi nahin, jab tak Allah mujhe apni rahmat mein na dhaanp le."
"627","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miyana-rawi ikhtiyar karo aur seedhe raho. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"628","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miyana-rawi ikhtiyar karo, seedhe raho, aur khush-khabri do. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"629","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! (Apne Musalman bhai se) kabhi kabhi milo, mohabbat badhegi."
"630","[AI-translation] Talhah bin Amr (Rahimahullah) se bhi isi tarah un ki sanad ke sath, ek doosri sanad ke sath marwi hai."
"631","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"632","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! (Apne Musalman bhai se) kabhi kabhi milo; mohabbat badhegi."
"633","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Umayyah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Kya main apni sawari bandhun phir Allah par bharosa karun, ya use khula chhod dun aur Allah par bharosa karun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use bandho phir (Allah par) bharosa karo."
"634","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Sadqa) un se shuru karo jin ki tum kafalat karte ho."
"635","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum logon ko aazmao (jab tum unhen aazmaoge, un ke batini jazbat tum par zahir ho jayenge, pas) tum un se talluq todne par majboor ho jaoge."
"636","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfoo'an bayan kiya ke: Logon ko aazmao (jab tum unhen aazmaoge, un ke batini jazbat tum par zahir ho jayenge, pas) tum un se talluq todne par majboor ho jaoge, aur logon par bharosa darja-ba-darja rakho."
"637","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ilm ko likh kar mehfooz rakho."
"638","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna jab Aap kisi aadmi ko naseehat kar rahe thay: Ae falan! Kam qarz lo tum aazad rahoge, kam gunah karo maut tum par aasan hogi, aur dekho aur ghaur karo ke tum apna beej (aulad ke liye) kahan rakh rahe ho, kyunke rag (qarabat ki) kheenchne wali hai (woh aulad mein badon ka akhlaq nikal lati hai)."
"639","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! ... Aur unhon ne yeh hadees mukhtasar bayan ki aur us mein unhon ne wa ahsin mujawarata man jaraka ke bajae wa ahsin jiwar man jaraka ke alfaz kahe."
"640","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki aur us mein kaha: Aur apne hamsaye ke sath achcha sulook karo (haqeeqi) Musalman ban jaoge aur kam hansa karo kyunke zyada hansna dil ko murda kar deta hai. Durust sanad yun hai an Abi Raja an Burd bin Sinan."
"641","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"642","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Apne hamsaye ke sath achcha sulook karo tum (haqeeqi) Musalman ban jaoge; apne sathi ke sath achcha sulook karo tum momin ban jaoge; Allah ke faraiz par amal karo tum aabid ban jaoge; aur Allah ki taqseem par razi raho tum zahid ban jaoge."
"643","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kisi aadmi ko naseehat karte hue farmaya: Duniya se be-raghbat ho jao Allah tum se mohabbat farmayega, aur jo logon ke paas hai us se be-parwah ho jao log tum se mohabbat karenge."
"644","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera hath pakda aur farmaya: Duniya mein is tarah raho goya tum ajnabi ya musafir ho, aur khud ko qabron walon mein shumar karo."
"645","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh chhod do jo tumhen shak mein dale us ke liye jo tumhen shak mein na dale. Aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya."
"646","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo, khwah woh zalim ho ya mazloom."
"647","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un par raham karo jo zameen par hain, aur woh jo aasmanon par hai tum par raham farmayega."
"648","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Narmi dikhao, tum par narmi ki jayegi."
"649","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Anas! Wuzu mukammal karo, tumhari umar badhegi; apne ghar walon ko salam karo, tumhare ghar mein barkat o khair badhegi; meri ummat ke har shakhs ko salam karo jise tum milo, tumhari nekiyan badhengi; hamesha taharat ki halat mein soya karo, kyunke agar tum us halat mein mar gae, to shaheed maroge; Chasht ki namaz padho, kyunke woh tum se pehle Allah ki taraf ruju' karne walon ki namaz hai; aur din-raat namaz padho, muhafiz farishte tumhari hifazat karenge; badon ki izzat karo, chhoton par raham karo, tum mujh se kal (Roz-e-Qayamat) miloge."
"650","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mangne (bheek) se jitna ho sake bacho."
"651","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main masjid mein dakhil hua aur wahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) akele baithe thay, pas main bhi un ke sath baith gaya. Main ne kaha ... aur (phir) unhon ne ek taweel hadees bayan ki jis mein yeh bhi mazkoor tha: Sach bolo agarche kadwa ho."
"652","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain: ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Allah se daro tum jahan bhi ho, aur buri baat ke peeche achchi baat karo woh use mita degi; aur logon se husn-e-khuluq ke sath pesh aao."
"653","[AI-translation] Ek Ansari aadmi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne rishton ko taza rakho, agarche sirf salam ke zariye hi ho."
"654","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu), jo Ansari sahabi thay, kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne rishton ko taza rakho, agarche sirf salam ke zariye hi ho."
"655","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein tohfe do, tumhare darmiyan mohabbat badhegi; hijrat karo, tumhare ghar walon aur bachchon ki izzat o martaba badhega; aur shareef logon ki ghaltiyon se darguzar karo."
"656","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein tohfe do, kyunke tohfa dil se keena door karta hai."
"657","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek doosre ko tohfe do, tumhare darmiyan mohabbat paida hogi. (Rawi-e-hadees, Abu Shanji ne kaha:) Tahabbu ba par shaddah ke sath hai, jis ki asl hubb hai, aur agar use halka padha jae, to woh muhabah se mushtaq hoga. (Ma'na janib-dari zahir karna)"
"658","[AI-translation] Abul Qasim Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Abdul Aziz Baghdawi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke unhon ne Abu Nasr al-Tammar se kaha: Jab main sun raha tha, kya Kausar bin Hakim ne tumhen, Makhul al-Dimashqi se, jo qabeela-e-Huzail ke aazad-kardah thay aur Kabulistan se thay, riwayat kiya, ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein tohfe do, kyunke tohfa keena door karta hai. Abu Nasr ne kaha: Haan."
"659","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Hakeem bint Wada' Khuza'iyyah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aapas mein tohfe do, kyunke yeh mohabbat badhata hai aur dilon se keena door karta hai."
"660","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein tohfe do, kyunke tohfe dushmani door karte hain."
"661","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khair o fazal khoobsurat chehron walon ke paas talash karo."
"662","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri taraf se pohanchao (jo suno), agarche sirf ek aayat ho, aur Bani Israil se riwayat karo, koi harj nahin."
"663","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin ki firasat se daro, kyunke woh Allah ke noor se dekhta hai."
"664","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imarat mein haram maal se daro, kyunke woh fasad ki jad hai."
"665","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Apni aulad ki izzat karo aur unhen achche aadab sikhao."
"666","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubadah bin Samit (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achchi baatein kaho tum faida paoge, aur buri baaton se khamosh raho tum mehfooz rahoge."
"667","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni aulad ke liye (behtareen) auratein muntakhab karo."
"668","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali (maut) ko kasrat se yaad karo, kyunke beshak, jab bhi banda use tangi mein yaad karta hai, woh use aasani deti hai, aur jab bhi woh use aasani mein yaad karta hai, woh use tangi deti hai."
"669","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"670","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali (maut) ko kasrat se yaad karo. Aur use bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur use bayan kiya."
"671","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lazzaton ko khatm karne wali (maut) ko kasrat se yaad karo, kyunke beshak, agar use kasrat-e-maal mein yaad kiya jae, to woh use ghatati hai, aur agar use qillat-e-maal mein yaad kiya jae, to woh use badhati hai."
"672","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Jab thakan mehsoos karo) apne dilon ko thodi der aaram do."
"673","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Umair (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imama bandho, woh tumhari hilm badhayega."
"674","[AI-translation] Mus'ab bin Sa'd (Rahimahullah) apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bhi ek hadees mein yeh farmaya aur unhon ne use bayan kiya: Amal karte raho, kyunke har shakhs ke liye woh a'mal aasan kar diye gae hain jin ke liye woh paida kiya gaya tha."
"675","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mohabbat karne wali aur bachche janne wali aurat se nikah karo, kyunke main tumhari tadad par doosri ummaton ke samne fakhr karunga."
"676","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri khao, kyunke sehri mein barkat hai. Imam Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat kiya hai."
"677","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sehri khao, kyunke sehri mein barkat hai."
"678","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap ko (aag se) bachao, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho."
"679","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap ko aag se bachao, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho. Yeh hadees Imam Malik ki riwayat mein nayaab hai. Abu Muhammad Tajibi ne hamein khabar di ke beshak Abu Muhammad Abdul Ghani bin Sa'id al-Hafiz ne use un se likha tha."
"680","[AI-translation] Abu Bahr Bakrawi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain: Hum Imam Shu'bah ke paas thay jab ek sa'il aaya, pas Shu'bah ne kaha: Sadqa karo. Lekin logon ne sadqa na kiya, pas unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hamein Abdullah bin Ma'qil se Adi bin Hatim se bayan kiya ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aag se bacho, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho. (Hadees sun kar bhi) sa'il ko kuch na diya gaya, pas Imam Shu'bah ne kaha: Al-A'mash ne hamein Khaisamah se Adi bin Hatim se bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aag se bacho, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho. Is baar bhi, logon ne (sa'il ko) kuch na diya, pas Imam Shu'bah ne kaha: Muhall bin Khalifah ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Adi bin Hatim ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aag se bacho, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho. Rawi kehta hai ke tab bhi logon ne kuch na diya, pas Imam Shu'bah ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Aaj main tumhen koi hadees bayan karta rahunga, ae kanjoos dukandaro! Utho aur yahan se chale jao."
"681","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"682","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aag se bacho, agarche aadhi khajoor ke sath hi ho."
"683","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne aap ko aag se bachao, agarche khajoor ke ek tukde ke sath hi ho. Imam Dar Qutni ne kaha: Ibn Munabbih ne hamein bataya: Main kisi ko nahin janta jis ne yeh hadees Simak bin Harb se riwayat ki ho sawae Ayyub bin Jabir ke. Aur woh (Ayyub) Muhammad bin Jabir Sahimi ke bhai hain; kaha jata hai ke woh apne bhai Muhammad bin Jabir se zyada qabil-e-e'temad hain."
"684","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"685","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki. Aur Imam Muslim ne use apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya hai ke: Bukhl se daro, kyunke us ne tum se pehle logon ko halak kiya."
"686","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Husain al-Ju'fi (Rahimahullah) se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"687","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon se be-niyaz raho, agarche miswak (dant-man jan) ke mu'amle mein hi ho."
"688","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon se be-niyaz raho, agarche miswak (dant-man jan) ke mu'amle mein hi ho."
"689","[AI-translation] Hazrat Muslamah bin Makhlad (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh jumla farmaya. Aur Hashimi ki riwayat mein hai, ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh jumla farmaya: Auraton ko kafi libas do taake woh apne gharon mein thehri rahen."
"690","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajjatul Wada ke dauran Mina mein Yaum-e-Nahr par khutba diya, aur unhon ne Nabi ke ek taweel khutbe ka zikr kiya jis mein Aap ne yeh bhi farmaya: Auraton ke bare mein khair ki naseehat qabool karo, kyunke woh tumhare paas qaidi hain."
"691","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Apne maal ki zakat ke zariye hifazat karo, apne beemaron ka sadqe ke zariye ilaj karo, aur museebat ka dua ke zariye muqabla karo."
"692","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam kehte hain ke mere walid ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne (Quran) padha, aur woh (log) jazbat se maghloob ho gae. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Jazbat se maghloob hone ke waqt ko dua ka mauqa samjho, kyunke woh rahmat hai."
"693","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi'ah bin Aamir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne use bayan kiya: (Apni duaon mein) Ya Zal-Jalali wal-Ikram kasrat se kaha karo."
"694","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kheti-badi mein rizq talash karo."
"695","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"696","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Darda (Raziyallahu anha) Hazrat Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karti hain, jinhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya: Jitna ho sake, duniya ki fikron se aazad raho."
"697","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Apna anaaj napo, us mein tumhare liye barkat hogi."
"698","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Apna anaaj napo, tumhare liye barkat hogi."
"699","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"700","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Mere raham-dil bandon mein se khair o fazal talash karo; un ke sae mein raho, kyunke meri rahmat un ke sath hai. Aur yeh khair o fazal un se na talash karo jin ke dil sakht hain, kyunke meri narazgi un ke sath hai. Abd al-Ghaffar bin Hasan bin Dinar is hadees ko bayan karne mein munfarid hain, aur woh hadees mein za'eef samjhe jate hain."
"701","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Hamesha khair o fazal talash karo, aur Allah Ta'ala ki rahmat ki khushbu-dar hawaaon ke peeche daudo. Beshak Allah Ta'ala apni rahmat ki khushbu-dar hawaaen apne bandon mein se jise chahta hai bhejta hai. Aur Allah se mango ke woh tumhare uyub chhupae aur tumhen un cheezon se mehfooz o mamoon rakhe jin se tum darte ho."
"702","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum bartam mein wuzu karo, pani ke bartam ko na uthao yahan tak ke woh bhar jae, aur wuzu ka pani jama karo; Allah tumhare bigde hue kaamon ko durust farmayega."
"703","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Fajr ki namaz ujale mein padho, kyunke woh ajar mein badi hai."
"704","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman al-Farsi (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Mitti se tayammum karo, kyunke woh tum par maan ki tarah shafeeq hai. Imam Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Faryabi ne use Sufyan al-Sauri se riwayat kiya hai."
"705","[AI-translation] Abu Usman Nahdi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mitti se tayammum karo, kyunke woh tum par maan ki tarah shafeeq hai."
"706","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya: Logon ko (aazad) chhod do; Allah Ta'ala ba'z ko ba'z ke zariye rizq deta hai."
"707","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni hajat poori karne mein unhen chhupane ke zariye madad mango, kyunke har nemat wala hasad kiya jata hai."
"708","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni hajat poori karne mein unhen chhupane ke zariye madad mango, kyunke har nemat wala hasad kiya jata hai."
"709","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghar khareedne se pehle achcha hamsaya talash karo, aur safar se pehle achcha sathi talash karo."
"710","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Ilaj karwao, kyunke jis ne beemari nazil ki hai us ne shifa bhi nazil ki hai."
"711","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke ek aadmi aaya aur Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki tareef karne laga. Hazrat Miqdad (Raziyallahu anhu) khade hue aur us ke chehre par mitti dalne lage. Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Tumhen kya ho gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main to us cheez ko nahin chhod sakta jise main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki:"
"712","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhen qayadat sonpi jae, achcha sulook karo aur apne ra'aya se narmi barto."
"713","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Apna khana muttaqi logon ko khilao aur mominon se neki karo."
"714","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"715","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Aap ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Allah se us lalach se panah mango jo dilon par mohar lagne ki taraf le jata hai."
"716","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Humaid Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dunyawi asbab hasil karne ka achcha tareeqa ikhtiyar karo, kyunke har shakhs ke liye woh a'mal aasan kar diye gae hain jin ke liye woh paida kiya gaya tha."
"717","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne dunyawi mu'amlat durust karo aur apni aakhirat ke liye is tarah amal karo goya tum kal marne wale ho."
"718","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara' bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Salam phailao, mehfooz rahoge."
"719","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef lae, log giroh-dar-giroh Aap ke paas aane lage, pas main bhi un mein tha jo Aap ke paas aae. Jab main ne Aap ka chehra dekha, main ne pehchan liya ke yeh jhoote ka chehra nahin. Main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Ae logo! Salam khoob phailao, (doosron ko) khilao, rishton ko jodo, aur raat mein namaz padho jab log so rahe hon; tum Jannat mein salamti ke sath dakhil hoge."
"720","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ka khayal rakho, kyunke beshak woh meri ummat ke behtareen log hain."
"721","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Meri itrat (mere qareebi rishtedaron) ka meri khatir khayal rakho."
"722","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Abul Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aqlmandon se hidayat mango, hidayat paoge, aur un ki na-farmani na karo, warna pachtaoge."
"723","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamein Jum'e ke din khutba diya aur farmaya: Apne Rabb ki taraf tauba karo marne se pehle, aur nek a'mal karo mashghool hone se pehle, aur us se apna talluq mazboot karo use kasrat se yaad kar ke."
"724","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mimbar se farmaya: Ae logo! Apne Rabb ki taraf tauba karo maut aane se pehle, aur nekiyan karne mein jaldi karo mashghool hone se pehle, aur us se apna talluq mazboot karo use kasrat se yaad kar ke aur khul kar aur chhup kar sadqa de kar, jo tumhare aur us ke darmiyan hai. Tumhari madad ki jayegi, tumhen ajar diya jayega, aur tumhen rizq diya jayega. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"725","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab muqarrar shari'i saza ka mu'amla na ho, to izzat wale logon ko saza dene se ruko."
"726","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sakhi shakhs ki laghzish se darguzar karo, kyunke jab bhi woh thokar khae, Allah hi us ka hath pakadne wala hai."
"727","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beemaron ki iyadat karo, janazon mein hazir ho; (aisa karna) tumhen aakhirat ki yaad dilayega."
"728","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin al-Musayyib aur Muraq Ajli se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Sa'd bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhuma) aur Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhuma) Hazrat Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) ki iyadat ke liye gae jab woh beemar thay. Salman rone lage, pas unhon ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Abdullah! Tumhen kis ne rulaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Yeh ehad jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hum se liya tha, lekin hum mein se kisi ne use poora nahin kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne bayan kiya: Tum mein se har ek ke paas duniya mein sirf itna zado-rah aur hissa hona chahiye jitna sawar apne safar mein sath rakhta hai."
"729","[AI-translation] Amr bin Maimoon Awdi (Rahimahullah) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kisi shakhs ko naseehat karte hue farmaya: Paanch cheezon se pehle paanch cheezon ko qeemti samjho: Apni jawani ko apne budhape se pehle, apni sehat ko apni beemari se pehle, apne maal ko apne faqr se pehle, apni faraghat ko apni mashghooliyat se pehle, aur apni zindagi ko apni maut se pehle."
"730","[AI-translation] Ibn Aishah apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek martaba khutba dete hue farmaya: Bande ko apne liye khud se zado-rah lena chahiye, apni aakhirat ke liye apni dunyawi zindagi se, apni jawani se apne budhape se pehle, aur apni zindagi se apni maut se pehle, kyunke is duniya ke baad koi ghar nahin sawae ya to Jannat ya Jahannam."
"731","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakam bin Umair Samali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya mein mehman ban kar raho, masjidon ko apna ghar banao, apne dilon ko riqqat aur narm-mizaji ka aadi banao, kasrat se ghaur o fikr aur roya karo, aur khwahishat tumhare andar hargiz ikhtilaf paida na kar dein."
"732","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gawahon ki izzat karo, kyunke Allah, un ke zariye, haq-daron ke huqooq dilata hai aur, un ke zariye, zulm rokta hai."
"733","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khuzaimah bin Sabit (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazloom ki dua se daro, kyunke woh badalon se oopar uthayi jati hai. Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Meri izzat o jalal ki qasam! Main zaroor tumhari madad karunga, agarche kuch muddat ke baad hi ho."
"734","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen qism ke logon par raham karo: Qaum ke maal-dar shakhs par jo faqeer ho gaya ho, izzat wale shakhs par jo zaleel ho gaya ho, aur aalim par jis se bewaqoof aur jahil log mazaq aur khel kar rahe hon."
"735","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raat ka khana khao, agarche sirf ek mutthi kharab khajoorein hon, kyunke raat ka khana chhodna budhapa lata hai."
"736","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Un ko dekho jo tum se neeche hain aur un ko na dekho jo tum se oopar hain, kyunke yeh zyada munasib hai taake tum Allah ki kisi nemat ko apne oopar haqeer na samjho."
"737","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko dekho jo tum se neeche hain aur un ko na dekho jo tum se oopar hain, kyunke yeh zyada munasib hai taake tum Allah ki nematon mein se kisi ko apne oopar haqeer na samjho."
"738","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Musalmanon ke raste se takleef-deh cheezein hatao; tumhari nekiyan badhengi."
"739","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne dost se hadd mein mohabbat karo, kyunke mumkin hai ke ek din woh tumhara dushman ban jae; aur apne dushman se hadd mein nafrat karo, kyunke mumkin hai ke ek din woh tumhara dost ban jae."
"740","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Main tumhen Allah ke taqwe ki waseeyat karta hun, kyunke woh tumhare a'mal ki bunyad hai, aur jihad ko apne oopar lazim kar lo, kyunke woh meri ummat ki rahbaniat hai. Aur jo tum apne bare mein jante ho (apne uyub, waghairah) use chahiye ke tumhen (logon ki burayi se) roke, aur apni zaban ko achchi baat kehne ke siwa roke rakho, kyunke aisa kar ke tum shaitan par ghalib aaoge."
"741","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ka ilm use nafa na de, us ki jahalat use nuqsan degi. Quran padho, kyunke woh tumhen (burayi se) rokega; agar woh tumhen na roke, to (goya) tum ne use padha hi nahin."
"742","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Amanat use wapas karo jis ne tumhen sonpi thi, aur us se khayanat na karo jis ne tum se khayanat ki."
"743","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"744","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mazdoor ki mazdoori us ka paseena khushk hone se pehle ada karo."
"745","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae ladke! Allah (ke ehkamat) ki hifazat kar, Allah teri hifazat farmayega. Allah (ke huqooq) ki hifazat kar, tu use apne samne payega. Use khush-hali mein pehchan woh tujhe (teri) tangi mein pehchanega. Aur jaan le ke beshak jo tujhe pohanch gaya hai woh tujh se tal nahin sakta tha aur jo tujh se tal gaya hai woh tujhe pohanch nahin sakta aur jaan le ke beshak agar sari makhlooq is baat par jama ho jae ke tujhe koi cheez ata kare jabke Allah tujhe woh cheez ata na karna chahta ho to woh (sari makhlooq) apne faisle par qadir nahin ho sakti. Ya woh (sari makhlooq) tujh se koi cheez chheenna chahe jabke Allah tujhe woh cheez ata karna chahe to woh (sari makhlooq) us par qadir nahin ho sakti. Aur jab mange, Allah se mang. Aur jab madad mange, Allah se madad mang. Aur jaan le ke beshak madad sabr ke sath aati hai, kushaish tangi ke sath aati hai, aur tangi ke sath aasani hai. Aur jaan le ke jo hone wala hai, qalam use likh chuka hai."
"746","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Jibreel (Alaihissalam) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur arz kiya: Ae Muhammad! Aap jitna chahen jee lein bil-aakhir Aap ne maut se humkinar hona hai. Jis se chahen dil laga lein bil-aakhir Aap ne us se juda hona hai aur jo chahen amal kar lein bil-aakhir Aap ne us ki jaza pani hai. Qazi Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Salamah bin Ja'far bin Ali al-Qasai ne kaha: Main ne un do hadeeson mein yeh alfaz zyada pae hain: Jibreel (Alaihissalam) tashreef lae aur arz kiya: Ae Muhammad! (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Aap jitna chahen jee lein bil-aakhir Aap ne maut se humkinar hona hai. Jis se chahen dil laga lein bil-aakhir Aap ne us se juda hona hai. Aur jo chahen amal kar lein bil-aakhir Aap ne us ki jaza pani hai. Phir kaha: Ae Muhammad! (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Momin ki izzat us ki namaz-e-shab mein hai, aur us ka waqar logon se be-niyazi mein hai."
"747","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us se neki karo jo mustahiq ho aur us se bhi jo mustahiq na ho, kyunke agar tum us se neki karo jo mustahiq hai, to tum ne sahi shakhs se neki ki, aur agar tum us se neki karo jo mustahiq nahin, to (us soorat mein) tum khud us ke mustahiq thay."
"748","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte thay: Ae tangi! Jitna door chahe ja (aakhirkar, khud hi) tu chali jayegi."
"749","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hazrat Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas tashreef lae, aur un ke paas khajooron ka dher tha. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Bilal! Yeh kya hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Yeh aap ke liye aur aap ke mehmanon ke liye hai. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tumhen darr nahin ke yeh tumhare liye Jahannam ki aag ka dhuwan ban sakta hai? Bilal! Kharch karo aur Arsh wale ki taraf se kami ka khauf na karo."
"750","[AI-translation] Masrooq se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Bilal! Hamein khilao. Pas woh ek mutthi khajoorein lae. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamein aur do. Pas unhon ne tumhen aur (khajoorein) din. Nabi ne farmaya: Hamein aur do. Pas unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Is ke siwa kuch nahin, aur yeh bhi main ne aap ke liye jama ki thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Bilal! Kharch karo, aur Arsh wale ki taraf se kami ka khauf na karo."
"751","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"752","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"753","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"754","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) apne walid, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-kardah, Hazrat Zaid bin Harisah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"755","[AI-translation] Hazrat Buraidah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"756","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un ko mukammal noor ki khush-khabri do Roz-e-Qayamat jo raat ke andhere mein masjidon ki taraf chalte hain."
"757","[AI-translation] Taliq bin Habib ne yeh hadees mukhtasar taur par marfoo'an bayan ki: Deen-dar aurat se nikah karo, tumhare hath khak-aalood hon."
"758","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un a'mal ko lazim pakdo jin ki tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah nahin thakta, lekin tum thak jate ho. Aur beshak, Allah ko sab se mehboob a'mal woh hain jo pabandi se kiye jayen, agarche thode hon. Aur yeh hadees Muslim bin Hajjaj ne apni sanad ke sath Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat ki hai, jo use marfoo'an bayan karti hain: Un a'mal ko lazim pakdo jin ki tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah nahin thakta (ajar dene se), lekin tum thak jate ho (amal karne se)."
"759","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tolo, jhuka kar tolo (khareedar ke haq mein)."
"760","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ka shareef aadmi tumhare paas aae, to us ki izzat karo."
"761","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ka shareef aadmi tumhare paas aae, us ki izzat karo."
"762","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jarir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, pas Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen yahan kya laya hai? Main ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main Islam qabool karne aaya hun. Woh kehte hain ke Nabi ne apni chadar mere liye bichha di aur farmaya: Jab kisi qaum ka shareef aadmi tumhare paas aae, us ki izzat karo."
"763","[AI-translation] Musa bin Anas apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab koi tum se milne aae, us ki izzat karo."
"764","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne use mukhtasar bayan kiya: Jab ghussa aae, khamosh raho."
"765","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mohabbat kare, use chahiye ke use ittila de."
"766","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se mohabbat kare, use chahiye ke use ittila de."
"767","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Jab do khalifaon se bai'at li jae, to un mein se pichhle ko qatl kar do."
"768","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Jab tum mein se koi kisi cheez ki khwahish kare, use chahiye ke dekhe woh kya khwahish kar raha hai, kyunke woh nahin janta ke us ki khwahish se us ke liye kya likha gaya hoga."
"769","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Jo miyana-rawi ikhtiyar kare woh mohtaj nahin hoga."
"770","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Ibrahim Hijri se un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se bhi isi tarah marwi hai."
"771","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah jahalat ki wajah se kabhi izzat nahin deta, hilm ki wajah se kabhi zaleel nahin karta, aur maal sadqa dene se kabhi kam nahin hota."
"772","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahmat sirf bad-bakht se chheeni jati hai."
"773","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda mashware ki wajah se kabhi nakam nahin hota, aur rae ko nazar-andaz karne ki wajah se kabhi kamyab nahin hota. Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: Aur mu'amle mein un se mashwara karen. Aur mu'amle mein un se mashwara karen. Aur Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya hai: Aur un ka mu'amla aapas mein mashware se (teh hota) hai. Aur un ka mu'amla aapas mein mashware se (teh hota) hai."
"774","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo istikhara kare woh nakam nahin hoga, aur jo (doosron se) mashwara kare woh pasheman nahin hoga, aur jo miyana-rawi ikhtiyar kare woh mohtaj nahin hoga. Imam Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Abdul Quddus ne use Hasan se riwayat kiya hai, aur un ka beta un se bayan karne mein munfarid hai."
"775","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh Quran par iman nahin rakhta jo us ki haram kardah cheezon ko halal samjhe."
"776","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"777","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh Quran par iman nahin rakhta jo us ki haram kardah cheezon ko halal samjhe."
"778","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suhaib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Woh Quran par iman nahin rakhta jo us ki haram kardah cheezon ko halal samjhe."
"779","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Bande ko sabr se zyada wasee' aur kushada koi rizq nahin diya gaya."
"780","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke mere ghar walon ne mujhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas bheja. Woh kehte hain: Main us waqt aaya jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ko khutba de rahe thay, pas main ne Aap ko farmate suna: Bande ko sabr se zyada kushada aur wasee' koi rizq nahin diya gaya."
"781","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Sadqa, jahan bhi woh maal se mil jae, us (maal) ko halak kar deta hai."
"782","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki. Abdullah bin Ahmad bin Hanbal kehte hain: Mere walid ne kaha: Us ka ma'na yeh hai ke khush-haal ya maal-dar shakhs sadqa ya zakat le leta hai (aur use apne maal se mila leta hai), halanke yeh sadqa fuqara ke liye hai."
"783","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqa maal ko kam nahin karta, aur jab banda zulm o zyadati ko mu'af kar de, Allah sirf us ki izzat badhata hai."
"784","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon ke liye auraton se badh kar nuqsan-deh koi fitna nahin chhoda."
"785","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon ke liye auraton se badh kar nuqsan-deh koi fitna nahin chhoda."
"786","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Hazrat Saeed bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon ke liye auraton se badh kar nuqsan-deh koi fitna nahin chhoda. Ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya."
"787","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usamah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne apne baad mardon ke liye auraton se badh kar nuqsan-deh koi fitna nahin chhoda."
"788","[AI-translation] Abu Nasirah kehte hain ke woh Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ke ek ghulam se mile, pas unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) se kuch suna hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Haan, main ne Hazrat Abu Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne bakhshish mangi us ne (gunah mein) israr nahin kiya, agarche woh us (gunah) ko din mein sattar martaba dohrae."
"789","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda jitna behtar sadqa de, Allah us ke tarke par utne hi behtar waris muqarrar farmata hai."
"790","[AI-translation] Ibn Shihab kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"791","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Main ne Jahannam jaisi koi (khaufnak) jagah nahin dekhi jis se bhagne wala soya hua ho (ghaflat mein), aur main ne Jannat jaisi koi (ne'mat bhari) jagah nahin dekhi jis ka talabgar soya hua ho (ghaflat mein)."
"792","[AI-translation] Is jaisi riwayat Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se ek doosri sanad ke sath bhi marwi hai."
"793","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Narmi jis cheez mein payi jae, use khubsurat bana deti hai, aur sakhti jis cheez mein payi jae, use badsurat bana deti hai."
"794","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behayayi jis cheez mein payi jae, use badsurat bana deti hai, aur haya jis cheez mein payi jae, use khubsurat bana deti hai."
"795","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek, wahid banda jo zaleel o haqeer hai woh hai jo ilm o adab se mehroom hai."
"796","[AI-translation] Hilal bin Yasaf kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke daur mein, ek aadmi zakhmi hua, pas Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ke liye tabeeb bulao. Sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) ne arz kiya: Allah ke Rasul! Kya tabeeb use kisi tarah faida pohancha sakta hai? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haan, Allah ne koi beemari nazil nahin ki magar us ki shifa bhi nazil ki hai."
"797","[AI-translation] Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Ali kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Allah Ta'ala ne bande ko us se badi koi zeenat nahin di jo us ke deen mein ehtiyat aur us ki sharmgah ke bare mein paak-damani hai."
"798","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande par apni nematein badhata hai, logon ki us se hajat bhi badh jati hai."
"799","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az bin Jabal (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"800","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ke gunah Allah duniya mein chhupae, woh use un (gunahon) par Roz-e-Qayamat ruswa nahin karega."
